@startuml US030_SSD
title US030 - Authentication and Authorization - SSD

actor "User" as User
participant "SEM4PI Backoffice System" as System

User -> System : enter username and password
System --> User : authentication result

alt authentication successful
    System --> User : show menu according to role
else invalid credentials
    System --> User : show authentication error
else disabled user
    System --> User : show access denied message
end

opt authenticated user changes password
    User -> System : enter old password and new password
    System --> User : password change result
end

opt authenticated user logs out
    User -> System : request logout
    System --> User : logout confirmation
end

@enduml